# IEEE 13 OCHRE loads (OpenDSS TpxLoads.dss, 40 triplex loads -> EnergyConsumer)
#
# The deck has no Loads.dss: these 40 triplex loads are the only loads.
# Each is a single-phase 240 V split-phase load across s1 s2 (wye, kv=0.208 in the deck,
# which is 120 V per leg; BaseVoltage bv_240v, as in the CDPSM house load).
# p/q are each load's own kW and kVAr as written (not totals).
# `batchedit load..* model=5` (Master.dss) applies to every load -> zip_constant_i.
# Load names are tl_house_N_240v; each load's bus is tl_house_N (the triplex line's far end).

Profile = cim18v17

Table EnergyConsumer: mRID, name, node, phases, phaseConnection, grounded, p (kW), q (kVAr), LoadResponse, BaseVoltage=bv_240v, EquipmentContainer=fdr_ieee13ochre
